# Yuriko, Blade of the Mighty: "During combat, players can't cast spells" (CR 101.2, 506.1) also stops suspend, a special
# action taken only if the card could be begun to be cast (CR 116.2f, 702.62a), though the special action itself is no
# activated ability. With Valley Floodcaller letting noncreature spells be cast as though they had flash, Bot1 is refused
# suspending Lotus Bloom in its turn 3 beginning of combat, and suspends it in the end step, outside combat.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Yuriko, Blade of the Mighty
Valley Floodcaller
Lotus Bloom
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
